cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this code or its outputs, please cite the version you used
  via its Zenodo DOI, together with the method papers listed below. The
  concept DOI 10.5281/zenodo.24020859 covers all versions.
title: "Global Warming Index"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Walsh
    given-names: Tristram
    affiliation: "Environmental Change Institute, University of Oxford"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0002-5227-9432"
# Concept DOI: all versions, resolves to the latest. There is deliberately no
# `version` or `date-released`: this file describes the project as a whole and
# needs no change per release. Each Zenodo version record gives the citation
# for its release, with the tag as its version.
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.24020859
repository-code: "https://github.com/tristramwalsh/global-warming-index"
url: "https://globalwarmingindex.org"
license: MIT
keywords:
